Control Statement : 
The statement or instructions are used to inform the computer to perform the task when the program is being executed.

Control statement can be categorized as :

a. Sequential control statement 
b. Conditional control statement 
   (Decision control statement) 
c. Looping control statement 
d. Switch control statement (Not directly supported in python)
   The concept of Switch control statement in python is achieved by:  
   i. match
   ii. if elif else 
   iii. dictionary

a. Sequential control statement 

   Input -------------> Formula Implementation(Process) ----------> Output 
ex: p,r,t               si = (p*r*t)/100                        output: si 
ex: f                   c = (f-32)*5/9                          output: c 

b. Conditional control statement 
   (Decision control statement)
    i. if statement 
    ii. if else statement 
    iii. nested if else statement 
    iv. if elif else  
